"En organizaciones pequeñas se admiten controles compensatorios (revisión posterior, registros) si se documentan.":"In small organizations compensating controls (after-the-fact review, logs) are accepted if documented.",
"Aceptar un riesgo residual alto compromete al negocio: lo aprueba la Gerencia.":"Accepting a high residual risk commits the business: Management approves it.",
"La 5.3 trata de asignar y comunicar roles, responsabilidades y autoridades.":"5.3 is about assigning and communicating roles, responsibilities and authorities.",
