"La Declaración de Aplicabilidad se elabora en el tratamiento de riesgos, apartado 6.1.3.":"The Statement of Applicability is produced in risk treatment, clause 6.1.3.",
"Sin SoA no hay forma de demostrar qué controles aplicas y por qué, y no se puede certificar.":"Without a SoA there's no way to show which controls you apply and why, and you can't get certified.",
"Asumir un riesgo de forma consciente y documentada es aceptarlo.":"Taking on a risk consciously and with documentation is accepting it.",
